  {
   "name": "StartHere",
   "type": "comment",
   "parameters": {},
   "seed_int": 0,
   "node_position": {
    "x": -1400,
    "y": -800
   },
   "title": "SCORCHED \u2014 authored fixed basis",
   "size": {
    "x": 1550,
    "y": 200
   },
   "color": {
    "type": "Color",
    "r": 0.18,
    "g": 0.23,
    "b": 0.28,
    "a": 1
   },
   "text": "64 metres per repeat (wider than a game hex), 4 cm relief. Deposits controls ash/cinder balance; GlassDistribution controls fused islands; Grain stays sub-metre; Fragments supplies sparse two-metre fractures. The 64-metre authored field carries irregular deposit and fused-island clusters across hex boundaries. Game exports fixed reference color+height and normal XY+ROUGHNESS B+AO. Normal Z is reconstructed by the scorch shader. No baked lighting or emission; nuclear-only fissure glow uses the reserved height band below 0.12. Severity is game data, not baked into these exports. Export with the stock CLI and RELOAD ASSETS. Select preview_s to change the material preview severity; Material exports the unchanged fixed basis."
  },
